nce\": \"Form submission is prevented when required fields (name, email, message) are missing or email format is invalid. Tested by attempting to submit with empty fields (form did not submit, focus moved to Email field) and with invalid email format \\\"notanemail\\\" (form did not submit). Browser-level validation prevents invalid submissions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Job posting form requires all fields: title, industry, employment type, location, salary (min/max), description, and at least one skill. Successfully posted job \\\"Test QA Engineer\\\" with valid data (salary $80k - $120k where min < max). Form accepted all required fields and rejected the job when any were missing during testing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate email addresses for the same job are not prevented.\", \"actual\": \"Successfully submitted second application to Senior Frontend Developer job with email john.test@example.com (which was already used for the same job). The form accepted the submission and displayed \\\"Application submitted!\\\" notification. No error message or duplicate check was shown.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted application appears in employer dashboard. After submitting applications, the application counts updated correctly: Senior Frontend Developer shows applications from Alex Johnson, Maria Garcia, and new submissions. Applications display with submitted name, email, phone, message, and date as distinct individual records. Success notification confirmed each submission.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Filter and search criteria immediately refresh results and count. Tested filtering by Industry (Technology): 8 jobs reduced to 2, count updated immediately to \\\"Showing 2 job